    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t01-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t01-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26天津事考）某服装店以每件120元的成本购进一批服装，全部按定价的8折销售，每件的利润率为20%。若该批服装全部售完后，总获利为3600元，则该店此批购入（）件服装。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "120"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "150"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "180"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "200"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          82
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          76
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t01-mother-01-p082.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第76页",
            "pdfPage": 82
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t01-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t01-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看每件成本120元、利润率20%，每件利润就是120×20%＝24元。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "总获利3600元，件数＝3600÷24＝150件，选B。题目问数量，给出的8折不必另求定价。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "利润率以成本为分母，先求每件利润就能直接反推数量。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
