      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t01-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26北京）一件商品的定价为成本的2.5倍，如果每件降价100元出售，单件利润比打八折出售低40元。则这种商品的成本是多少元／件？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "100"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "120"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "125"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "150"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
