    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t01-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t01-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设定价P、成本C。两种卖法成本相同，利润差40元就是售价差40元，因此0.8P－(P－100)＝40。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "得到100－0.2P＝40，所以P＝300；又P＝2.5C，得到C＝120元，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "同一件商品比较利润差时，成本可以抵消，先比较售价差。"
        }
      ],
